Drawings for graphics.import (island unit fp-i5), written by hand for the
island and dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.

outline.dxf  an ASCII DXF (AC1009) in millimeters ($INSUNITS 4): one closed
             polyline, a 20 by 10 rectangle from the origin, and one arc of
             radius 3 centered at (10, 5) from 0 to 180 degrees.
logo.svg     an SVG 20 by 10 mm: two closed paths, a square and a triangle,
             stroked, no fill, no script and no external reference.
